{
  "name": "01 - Intake / SMS Import",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0003",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SMS Import\n\nSingle Responsibility: webhook entrypoint for any SMS-forwarding tool (e.g. MacroDroid, Tasker, an iPhone Shortcut, a Twilio inbound webhook) that posts a raw SMS into this n8n instance. Checks a secret header, normalizes the payload, filters out obvious non-transaction messages (OTPs, promos), then hands off to 02 - Processing / Parse Transaction. The whole pipeline result is returned in the HTTP response.\n\nThis is a parallel, n8n-native path — independent of the app's own /api/imports/sms endpoint (which uses a different, already-battle-tested pipeline). Built at explicit request even though it duplicates that logic; the two will not stay in sync automatically.\n\nSECURITY: requires header `X-BudgetFlow-Webhook-Secret` matching the `N8N_SMS_WEBHOOK_SECRET` n8n environment variable. Missing or mismatched → HTTP 401 `{ ok: false, error: \"Unauthorized\" }`, rejected before Parse Transaction ever runs. This secret is intentionally separate from BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY — do not reuse it. In production, reached via the BudgetFlow app's own relay (POST /api/integrations/n8n/sms-relay), not called directly from the public internet.\n\nNON-TRANSACTION FILTER: messages matching common OTP/promo phrasing (otp, one time password, verification code, do not share, login code, promotional offer) are recognized after normalization and short-circuited straight to a 200 `{ ok: true, ignored: true, reason: \"not_a_transaction\" }` response — they never reach Parse Transaction, Duplicate Check, Categorize Transaction, Create Transaction, or Import Failed.\n\nExpected POST body (once authenticated): { from?: string, body: string, receivedAt?: ISOString }. Adjust 'Normalize Payload' if your SMS forwarder uses different field names (e.g. Twilio sends { From, Body }).\n\nWebhook URL (after import, self-hosted): <your-n8n-instance>/webhook/budgetflow/sms-import",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0004",
      "name": "SMS Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        280
      ],
      "webhookId": "node-0005",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "budgetflow/sms-import",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0009",
      "name": "Check Secret",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
