      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"02 - Processing / Parse Transaction\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import). This one call cascades through the whole pipeline (Validate → Duplicate Check → Categorize → Create Transaction → BudgetFlow handles all downstream business logic)."
    },
